{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/wbyxsnqp","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":65,"top":118,"width":1140,"height":42},"text":"Einstein Aij ayuda a modelar emisión; no es “puntaje de detección”","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":19,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#137C8B","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/jepg3ipg","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":75,"top":210,"width":1070,"height":72},"text":"Aij (s⁻¹) describe la probabilidad de emisión espontánea por unidad de tiempo.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":30,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#102A43","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/idgfud8v","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":75,"top":320,"width":1060,"height":92},"text":"Con degeneraciones, energías, temperatura y función de partición alimenta modelos de excitación y transferencia radiativa.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":25,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#18324A","alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5g7y5s7m","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":75,"top":450,"width":1050,"height":65},"text":"En nuestros archivos Aij no está incluido. log10_I_300K_nm2_MHz ≠ log10(Aij).","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":27,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#D97745","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4fyxwnq1","slideIndex":6,"position":{"left":75,"top":550,"width":1050,"height":85},"text":"Mejora ejecutable: recuperar parámetros exactos CDMS/JPL y modelar varias líneas con LTE/no-LTE; comprobar blends.","geometry":"rect","lineWidth":0,"style":{"fontSize":23,"typeface":"Aptos","color":"#137C8B","bold":true,"alignment":"left"}}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/7g9m9s","slideIndex":6,"text":"La guía lo advierte explícitamente: la columna de intensidad a 300 K no equivale a Aij. Consultar documentación de la transición exacta y versionar los datos. No inventar coeficientes."}
